    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZalithLauncher/ZalithLauncher2/tarball/2.7.1",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ZalithLauncher/ZalithLauncher2/zipball/2.7.1",
    "body": "## Updates:\r\n- #2065: Added Compress and Share Save feature to the saves management screen (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2062: Added support for independently configuring renderer plugin environment variables in version settings (by @youfeng11, @MovTery)\r\n- #2083: Added \"Browse in Other File Managers\" option to the file manager more menu (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Refactors:\r\n- #2066: Pinned the main interface card toolbar to the bottom of the screen (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Changes:\r\n- #2077: Dialogs displaying SDL-side messages now use the launcher theme (by @MovTery)\r\n\r\n## Fixes:\r\n- #2053: Percent-encode the file name in CurseForge download links (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2049: Validate the displacement direction input when dragging cards, rejecting invalid direction vectors (by @dryfish09)\r\n- #2064: Fixed skin preview in the wardrobe not displaying until capes finish loading (by @youfeng11)\r\n- #2068: Mod update check repeatedly prompting for the same version due to an expired baseline date (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2078: SDL side unable to properly open links or browse directories (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2079: Render state not restored after the in-game surface is rebuilt, causing misaligned rendering (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2080: Removed the NeoForge early loading screen, fixing the interface freeze issue (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2082: SDL_EGL_LIBRARY is now constructed following the plugin path convention and validated for existence (by @MovTery)\r\n- #2089: Fixed the internal dialog popped up by the input method being mistakenly closed by the launcher (by @MovTery)",
